  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. minus thirty outside, the aurora's out and the ice is holding. first place. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Traction Protocol\n01:55 Countersteer Approach\n04:09 Final Icefield\n06:22 Rev Limit Theory\n08:36 Hyper Crevasse\n10:48 Glacier Circuit\n13:01 Hidden Boost\n15:14 Hyper Wheelspin\n17:27 Northern Lights Loop\n19:41 Frostbite Approach\n21:53 Black Ice Run\n24:04 Permafrost\n26:18 Snowblind\n28:32 Polar Stage\n30:43 High Turbo\n32:57 Electric Tundra\n35:11 Velocity Stage\n37:25 Whiteout Drive\n39:39 Overdrive Protocol\n41:52 Hoarfrost\n44:06 Momentum Circuit\n46:18 Aurora Line\n48:31 Sector Three Rush\n50:42 Broken Coldstart\n52:55 Electric Floe\n55:06 Electric Downforce\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
